Lokadin, different people mean different things when they describe
what the Singularity is. But here is Robin's best effort from when I
asked him to translate "The Singularity":

la co'i ve'e terzmiku

That which is named the achievative moment of automation-conditions
over the whole of space.

You might want to make that sumti the X1 place of {cu cabna jibni} or
something like that to get "The Singularity Is Near".

-Eppcott

